#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/bmc_remedy_approvals.rst:86
msgid "How Approvals Work"
msgstr "Fonctionnement des approbations"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/bmc_remedy_approvals.rst:88
msgid "When a user triggers an action covered by a Remedy approval policy:"
msgstr "Lorsqu'un utilisateur déclenche une action couverte par une règle d'approbation Remedy :"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/bmc_remedy_approvals.rst:90
msgid ""
"|morpheus| creates a **Change Request** in Remedy (CHG:Infrastructure "
"Change form)"
msgstr "|morpheus| crée une **demande de modification** dans Remedy (formulaire CHG:Infrastructure Change)"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/bmc_remedy_approvals.rst:91
msgid "The provisioning request enters a **Pending** state in |morpheus|"
msgstr "La requête de provisionnement passe à l'état **En cours** dans |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/bmc_remedy_approvals.rst:92
msgid ""
"|morpheus| polls the Remedy Change Request for status updates (every 5 "
"minutes)"
msgstr "|morpheus| interroge la demande de modification Remedy pour obtenir les mises à jour d'état (toutes les 5 minutes)"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/bmc_remedy_approvals.rst:93
msgid ""
"When the Change Request is approved in Remedy, |morpheus| automatically "
"proceeds with the action"
msgstr "Lorsque la demande de modification est approuvée dans Remedy, |morpheus| poursuit automatiquement l'action"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/bmc_remedy_approvals.rst:94
msgid ""
"When the Change Request is rejected or cancelled in Remedy, |morpheus| "
"denies the request"
msgstr "Lorsque la demande de modification est rejetée ou annulée dans Remedy, |morpheus| refuse la requête"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/bmc_remedy_approvals.rst:97
msgid "Change Request Details"
msgstr "Détails de la demande de modification"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/bmc_remedy_approvals.rst:99
msgid "The Change Request created in Remedy includes:"
msgstr "La demande de modification créée dans Remedy inclut :"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/bmc_remedy_approvals.rst:101
msgid ""
"**Summary** — Description of the requested action (provisioning details, "
