#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/bmc_remedy_approvals.rst:140
msgid ""
"Verify the Change Request was approved/rejected in Remedy (not just "
"commented on)"
msgstr "Vérifiez que la demande de modification a été approuvée/rejetée dans Remedy (et non simplement commentée)"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/bmc_remedy_approvals.rst:141
msgid "Check that the Remedy service account still has valid credentials"
msgstr "Vérifiez que le compte de service Remedy dispose toujours d'identifiants valides"

